{# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   SCENE ELEMENT SPRITE
   All scene-composer SVG symbols. Included once on the home page.
   Each <symbol> has a viewBox that matches the element's natural shape.
   Reference with <use href="#el-NAME"/>.

   Conventions:
   - Use currentColor where the element should pick up the layer's CSS color
   - Use specific fills only for items that have inherent color (clownfish, etc.)
   - Keep paths compact (integer coords where possible)
   ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
